<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DRAW WITH GLOUCESTERSHIRE IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DRAW WITH GLOUCESTERSHIRE IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, England 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia drew with Gloucestershire on the final day of their three-day tour match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 249 all out and 354-4 declared, Gloucestershire 350 all out.</p>
</text>
